\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces AIME-24 at budget 2048 (subset scale: 30 problems $\times $ 4 seeds; own reference bank at $0.371$). Free-running separates the three policies ($0.283$ / $0.217$ / $0.142$); their readout accuracies are \emph  {identical} at $0.462$ --- same correctness on every one of 120 conditions, with 85 of 93 defined rows converging to the same extracted answer through visibly different generations. Held-trace evaluation cannot see the difference between these policies at all; no press approaches the reference (no $>$100\% regime).}}{18}{figure.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:aime}{{7}{18}{AIME-24 at budget 2048 (subset scale: 30 problems $\times $ 4 seeds; own reference bank at $0.371$). Free-running separates the three policies ($0.283$ / $0.217$ / $0.142$); their readout accuracies are \emph {identical} at $0.462$ --- same correctness on every one of 120 conditions, with 85 of 93 defined rows converging to the same extracted answer through visibly different generations. Held-trace evaluation cannot see the difference between these policies at all; no press approaches the reference (no $>$100\% regime)}{figure.caption.14}{}}
\newlabel{fig:aime@cref}{{[figure][7][]7}{[1][17][]18}{}{}{}}
